vl 3</span></div></div><button class="delve-btn px-3 py-1 text-sm" aria-label="Close" data-pad-back="true">✕</button></div><div class="delve-panel mt-3 px-3 py-2" data-testid="item-compare"><div class="mb-1 text-center text-[11px] text-stone-400">Empty slot — pure gain</div><div class="flex"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center gap-0.5"><span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400">Power</span><span class="delve-display text-base font-bold" style="color: rgb(74, 222, 128);">▲ +21%</span></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center gap-0.5"><span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400">Damage</span><span class="delve-display text-base font-bold" style="color: rgb(74, 222, 128);">▲ +9%</span></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center gap-0.5"><span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400">Toughness</span><span class="delve-display text-base font-bold" style="color: rgb(74, 222, 128);">▲ +35%</span></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-3 text-xs" data-testid="attune-delta"><span style="color: rgb(255, 106, 43);">🔥 +2 Fire</span></div><div class="mt-1 text-center text-[11px] text-stone-400" data-testid="attune-note">Attunement grows your mana pool and powers abilities of its element.</div></div><div class="mt-3 space-y-1.5"><div class="text-sm" style="color: rgb(214, 211, 209);">+7 Armor</div><div class="text-sm" style="color: rgb(214, 211, 209);">+18 Max Life</div><div class="my-1 h-px bg-white/10"></div><button type="button" disabled="" class="block w-full rounded-md px-1.5 py-1 text-left" style="background: transparent; outline: none; cursor: default; transition: background 0.3s;" data-testid="item-affix"><div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm"><span style="color: rgb(147, 197, 253);">+2 Fire Attunement</span><span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-300">PERFECT</span></div><div class="delve-quality mt-1"><span style="width: 95%; backgr